# The format gate is JavaScript only, on purpose: `npm run format` globs
# **/*.{js,jsx}, so only entries that can match a .js or .jsx file matter here.
#
# The four stylesheets and the three docs are hand-tuned — grouped selectors,
# aligned comments carrying measured contrast ratios, hand-wrapped prose — and a
# reflow would rewrite every paragraph and bury the next real edit. They are outside
# the glob already, so they need no entry.
#
# dist/ does need one: dist/sw.js is generated JavaScript, so the glob reaches it.
dist/
